  isAutomatic: 0
  ChangeTimeOfAction: 3
  Text: "It's quite deserted. We got lucky on that one. \n \nNot much around except
    a <link>24/7 Petro Station</link>, which happens to be about twenty feet from
    the huge inflatable dome we just put blocking half the road to conceal the <link>truck</link>.
    \nThat's where our luck ends.  \n\nThat Mike fellow passed through here earlier,
    leaving a <link>three-wheeled trail</link> on some <link>fluorescent green goo</link>
    that leaked from <link>the cargo</link>. The smear stretches far down the road,
    in the same direction the truck appeared to be headed. "
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?


    The report is on your
    desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
